 "summary": {
  "headline": "Nvidia forms open AI-security alliance; Kimi K3 weights released",
  "body": "Two stories tilted the day toward the brighter endings. Nvidia launched the Open Secure AI Alliance, a 30-plus member group including Microsoft, IBM and Hugging Face, to build open AI cybersecurity tools after the OpenAI breach; OpenAI, Google and Anthropic were absent. That is a modest boost to Alignment & Control, which helps Protector God and Gatekeeper and pulls Conquerors back. Moonshot also published the full Kimi K3 weights under a modified MIT license, letting anyone self-host a near-frontier model. Spreading capability widely reduces Power Concentration, which helps Libertarian Utopia and Egalitarian Utopia and trims 1984 and Benevolent Dictator. Horizon Balance recovered to -0.05.",
  "movers_note": "Libertarian Utopia +0.2, from the Nvidia alliance (+0.12) and the Kimi K3 weights (+0.09). Egalitarian Utopia +0.2, from the Nvidia alliance (+0.12) and the Kimi K3 weights (+0.06). Zookeeper -0.2, mostly from the Nvidia alliance (-0.12) and fading earlier news (-0.04).",
